<FTL>
	<text name="tooltip_sc_pilot_ready">Temporarily increase accuracy and projectile speed by half your evade.</text>
	<text name="tooltip_sc_pilot_manned">Piloting must be manned to activate.</text>

	<text name="stat_bio_weapon">Bio-Weapon: Hull and system damage are negated unless the target ship is organic.</text>
	<text name="stat_rust_weapon">Rust-Weapon: Hull and system damage are negated unless the target ship is automated.</text>
	<text name="stat_fire_fill">Lights all tiles on fire in any room hit</text>
	<text name="stat_breach_fill">Creates a breach on all tiles in any room hit</text>
